    <placement-and-justification>No new service, DI registration, endpoint, option, job or package. New surface: a private static list and a private static predicate inside the existing RecordContainerResolver, and an optional constructor parameter on a test fixture. Existing: ChildAncestorLinks / the existing catch filters. Extension: extended in place. Cost of doing nothing: a to-do under a report card of a SECURE matter writes the matter's bytes to a shared BU container (SPE cannot un-share), and a Dataverse timeout surfaces as a generic 500 "Upload failed".</placement-and-justification>
