    <changes>
      (1, BLOCKING) sprk_invoice.sprk_regardingagreement (live lookup → sprk_agreement, which belongs to a matter/project) is now an INTERMEDIATE on the invoice: an invoice regarding an agreement — with no typed root, or a typed link to a different non-secure root — refuses container_ancestor_unverifiable 409 (inbound: permanent) instead of resolving the BU container (or, on the communication path, the archive). Live: 0 of 10 invoices set it.
      (2) Systematic READ-ONLY live sweep (spaarkedev1, 2026-10-01): every Lookup/Customer/Owner column, with targets, of sprk_todo (25), sprk_event (42), sprk_invoice (22), sprk_workassignment (28), sprk_project (24), sprk_matter (24), contact (23) = 188 columns; every target (24 entities) swept for its own lookups and classified root / intermediate / party / reference-principal. ChildAncestorLinks rebuilt as one literal column→target list per entity with kinds derived from a single KindByEntity table. Consequences: sprk_regardingservicerequest moved from ROOT link to INTERMEDIATE on to-do/event (a service request cannot carry sprk_issecure, hangs off matter/project/WA, and as a CORE record gets nothing stamped above it — the f2 test had pinned the fail-open as correct; live 0 rows); NEW entries sprk_workassignment (root links sprk_regardingproject/matter, intermediates sprk_regarding{communication,event,invoice}, pair; its own flag still decides first; live 9 of 22 regard a root — outcome unchanged at +1 read — and 1 regards an invoice, now held), sprk_project (pair only; 0 live), contact (sprk_invoice intermediate; 0 live; four-argument overload now reads a contact — no production caller passes a fallback). sprk_matter has no sprk_regardingrecordid, so no entry. ChildRecordRead_RequestsEveryLinkAndIntermediateColumn rewritten to carry the literal swept snapshot for all 7 entities and assert the read EXACTLY equals the columns whose target is root/intermediate plus the pair; it fails on an unclassified target; the false "verified on live" wording replaced.
